### End-to-end walkthrough. Run requests top to bottom.
### Use http://localhost:8080 for docker compose, http://localhost:5079 for `dotnet run`.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5079

### 1. Sign up an organisation (Free plan) — copy accessToken into @token below
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantName": "Acme",
  "ownerEmail": "owner@acme.test",
  "ownerDisplayName": "Olivia Owner",
  "password": "correct horse battery"
}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### 2. Or sign in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@acme.test", "password": "correct horse battery" }

### 3. Who am I? (tenant, plan usage, permissions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create a product (Inventory opens a stock record via ProductCreated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "WIDGET-1", "name": "Widget", "description": "A very useful widget", "price": 12.50 }

### 5. Receive stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "WIDGET-1", "quantity": 100 }

### 6. Place an order (price comes from Catalog; confirmed asynchronously)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "customerEmail": "ada@example.com",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "WIDGET-1", "quantity": 7 } ]
}

### 7. List orders (status should become Confirmed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Stock levels (7 reserved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Revenue report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Emails sent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Invite a teammate (the accept link appears in the notifications log / API log)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/users/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mia@acme.test", "displayName": "Mia Member", "role": "Member" }

### 12. Upgrade the plan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/tenant/plan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plan": "Pro" }

### 13. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
